Z||000008||fieroshop||04-14-2000||11:18 AM||||Personnally I recomend synthetic oil. Reason: all fossil oils leave a carbon deposit in the engine which after a period of time is harmful to the engine. Carbon deposits clog oil passages and restrict the flow of oil. It is like human beings. Arteries clog and they end up with a heart attack or bypass surgery. That is what your engine will do with fossil oils. Synthetics do not leave a carbon deposit henceforth no block of the arteris just like your heart. Oil is the lifeline of the engine just as blood is the lifeline of your body.||||reg||1
